    "author": "ㅇㅇ",
    "published": "11.06 19:03:48",
    "depth": 0,
    "body": "충락아\n발업은\n하지\n말아다오",
    "body_html": "<div class=\"coment_dccon_txt cbg_3b4890\"><p class=\"txtcon_txt ctxt_ffffff\">충락아<br>발업은<br>하지<br>말아다오</p></div>",
    "deleted": false
